ent","demo":"<div class=\"steps-demo\"><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>填写信息</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node current\"><i>2</i><span>确认订单</span></span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"steps-demo\"><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Fill in the information</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node current\"><i>2</i><span>Confirm order</span></span></div>","when":"用户正走到这一步时高亮它","when_en":"Highlight it when the user has reached this step"},{"cn":"全部完成","en":"Finished","demo":"<div class=\"steps-demo\"><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>下单</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>支付</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>收货</span></span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"steps-demo\"><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Place an order</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Pay</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Receive goods</span></span></div>","when":"所有步骤完成后显示完成状态","when_en":"Display completion status after all steps are completed"},{"cn":"出错状态","en":"Error","demo":"<div class=\"steps-demo\"><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>下单</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node error\"><i>!</i><span>支付失败</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar\"></span><span class=\"steps-node\"><i>3</i><span>收货</span></span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"steps-demo\"><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Place order</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node error\"><i>!</i><span>Payment failed</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar\"></span><span class=\"steps-node\"><i>3</i><span>Receipt</span></span></div>","when":"某一步失败时，标出失败步骤并提供修正指引","when_en":"When a step fails, mark the failed step and provide correction guidance"}],"use":[{"t":"流程有<b>固定先后顺序</b>：下单 → 支付 → 完成","m":"tabs-steps"},{"t":"长表单<b>拆成几步</b>，一步一步填不压","m":"steps-form"},{"t":"让用户知道<b>现在第几步、还剩几步</b>，心里有底","m":"steps-current"},{"t":"跨页面的<b>注册 / 发布流程</b>，步骤本身就是导航","m":"steps-flow"}],"dont":[{"t":"切换平级内容时应使用 {c:tabs}，而不是步骤条","m":"steps-as-tabs","bad":true},{"t":"步骤之间<b>没有先后顺序</b>，先做哪个都行","m":"steps-noseq","bad":true},{"t":"步骤较多且缺少分组，流程显得冗长 → 拆成阶段或分页任务","m":"steps-many","bad":true},{"t":"一步能完成的事<b>硬拆成三步</b>","m":"steps-split","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"结账分为地址、配送、付款和确认四步。怎样让用户知道自己走到哪一步？","options":[{"id":"steps","label":"显示四个步骤，标出当前和已经完成的步骤","feedback":"对。步骤条表达多步流程的位置和进展，不替代每步自己的表单校验。","correct":true},{"id":"tabs","label":"把四步做成可以随意跳转的标签页","feedback":"结账步骤有顺序和完成条件，任意跳过会破坏流程。","correct":false},{"id":"spinner","label":"只在标题里写“第 2/4 步”，不展示各步骤名称和完成情况","feedback":"“第 2/4 步”只能说明数量，用户仍不知道前后分别是什么，也无法快速确认哪些步骤已经完成。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Checkout has Address, Delivery, Payment, and Confirm, and people may return to an earlier step. How should current position be shown?","options":[{"id":"steps","label":"Use Steps to mark current and completed stages, allowing return to completed stages","feedback":"Correct. Steps express position and progress in a multi-step flow; they do not replace validation inside each form.","correct":true},{"id":"tabs","label":"Use freely jumpable Tabs as if the stages were unrelated pages","feedback":"Checkout stages have order and completion conditions; arbitrary skipping breaks the flow.","correct":false},{"id":"spinner","label":"Show only a Spinner between stages without showing total stages","feedback":"A waiting state does not communicate flow position or remaining stages.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"结账流程请加入 Steps，清楚标出地址、配送、付款和确认；当前步骤、已完成步骤和可返回步骤要可见。完成地址后进入配送，再返回修改地址，确认步骤状态与已保存内容一致。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Add Steps to checkout for Address, Delivery, Payment, and Confirm, making current, completed, and returnable stages visible. Complete Address, enter Delivery, then return to edit Address and confirm stage state and saved content remain consistent."}},"scenes":["电商下单流程","多步表单填写","新用户注册引导","发布审核流程"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Checkout","m":"tabs-steps"},{"t":"Account setup","m":"steps-form"},{"t":"Application process","m":"steps-current"},{"t":"A fixed sequence with a clear finish","m":"steps-flow"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use it for optional tabs or categories","m":"steps-as-tabs","bad":true},{"t":"Hide how many stages remain","m":"steps-noseq","bad":true},{"t":"Allow jumping ahead when required data is missing","m":"steps-many","bad":true},{"t":"Change the order after the process begins","m":"steps-split","bad":true}],"scenes":["Checkout","Onboarding","Application form","Import wizard"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);padding:12px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div class=\"steps-sc\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <span class=\"s-node done\"><i>✓</i>Confirm order</span><span class=\"s-bar done\"></span>\n        <span class=\"s-node on\"><i>2</i>Payment</span><span class=\"s-bar\"></span>\n        <span class=\"s-node\"><i>3</i>Receipt</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px\">\n        <span style=\"width:32px;height:32px;flex:none;border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px\">🎧</span>\n        <span style=\"flex:1\">Shengkuo Q45 Noise Canceling Headphones ×1</span><b>¥ 899</b>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:10px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Total <b style=\"color:var(--red);font-size:15px\">¥ 899</b></span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Go to payment</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);padding:12px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div class=\"steps-sc\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <span class=\"s-node on\"><i>1</i>Basic information</span><span class=\"s-bar\"></span>\n        <span class=\"s-node\"><i>2</i>Contact information</span><span class=\"s-bar\"></span>\n        <span class=\"s-node\"><i>3</i>Complete</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:4px\">Name</div><input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;font-size:12px;padding:6px 10px\" value=\"Alex Chen\"></div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:4px\">City</div><span class=\"custom-select\" data-custom-select style=\"width:100%;min-width:0\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-trigger\" data-custom-select-trigger\n      aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:6px 10px\">\n      <span class=\"custom-select-value\" data-custom-select-value>Shenzhen</span>\n      <i class=\"select-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </button>\n    <span class=\"custom-select-menu\" role=\"listbox\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option on\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"Shenzhen\">\n        <span>Shenzhen</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"Guangzhou\">\n        <span>Guangzhou</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"Hangzhou\">\n        <span>Hangzhou</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button>\n    </span>\n  </span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Next</button></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);padding:12px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);text-align:center\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">Welcome to Museon</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin:2px 0 10px\">One step left, verify your email to complete the registration</div>\n      <div class=\"steps-sc\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <span class=\"s-node done\"><i>✓</i>Create account</span><span class=\"s-bar done\"></span>\n        <span class=\"s-node on\"><i>2</i>Verify email</span><span class=\"s-bar\"></span>\n        <span class=\"s-node\"><i>3</i>Get started</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">2</span>\n        <span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">6</span>\n        <span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-3)\"></span>\n        <span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-3)\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;font-size:12px\">Verify and complete registration</button>\n    </div>","<div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);padding:12px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Article publishing progress</b><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Under review</span></div>\n      <div class=\"steps-sc\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <span class=\"s-node done\"><i>✓</i>Submit for review</span><span class=\"s-bar done\"></span>\n        <span class=\"s-node on\"><i>2</i>Preliminary review of content</span><span class=\"s-bar\"></span>\n        <span class=\"s-node\"><i>3</i>Final review</span><span class=\"s-bar\"></span>\n        <span class=\"s-node\"><i>4</i>Publish</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">📄\"Mountain Life: Weekend Hiking Equipment List\" has entered the <b>preliminary content review</b> and is expected to be completed within 2 hours</div>\n    </div>"],"distinctions":[{"label":"Progress","text":"{c:steps} shows named stages in order. {c:progress} is better for continuous work such as upload or processing completion.","targetId":"progress"},{"label":"Spinner","text":"{c:steps} helps someone complete a multistep task. {c:spinner} only says the system is processing; it does not move the person to a new step.","targetId":"spinner"},{"label":"Number stepper","text":"In systems such as Material Design, {c:steps} can also be called a Stepper for a multistep flow. The plus/minus control beside an {c:input-number} may use the same name, so say steps indicator or number stepper when clarity matters.","targetId":"input-number"}],"variants":[{"demo":"<div class=\"steps-demo\"><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Fill in the information</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node current\"><i>2</i><span>Confirm order</span></span></div>","when":"Highlight it when the user has reached this step"},{"demo":"<div class=\"steps-demo\"><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Place an order</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Pay</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Receive goods</span></span></div>","when":"Display completion status after all steps are completed"},{"demo":"<div class=\"steps-demo\"><span class=\"steps-node done\"><i>✓</i><span>Place order</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar done\"></span><span class=\"steps-node error\"><i>!</i><span>Payment failed</span></span><span class=\"steps-bar\"></span><span class=\"steps-node\"><i>3</i><span>Receipt</span></span></div>","when":"When a step fails, mark the failed step and provide correction guidance"}]},"usageMocks":{"tabs-steps":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>填写信息</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>2</i>确认订单</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>3</i>完成支付</span></div></div>","steps-form":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>基本信息</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>2</i>联系方式</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>3</i>完成</span></div><span class=\"mk-input\"><em>姓名</em></span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">下一步</span></div></div>","steps-current":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>下单</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>2</i>支付</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>3</i>收货</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">第 2 步，还差 1 步</span></div>","steps-flow":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>创建账号</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>2</i>完善资料</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>3</i>开始使用</span></div></div>","steps-as-tabs":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>评论</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>2</i>历史</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>3</i>收藏</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">这是并列内容，用标签页</span></div>","steps-noseq":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>头像</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>2</i>昵称</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>3</i>签名</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">先填哪个都行，不算步骤</span></div>","steps-many":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>填写</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>2</i>验证</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>3</i>协议</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>4</i>问卷</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>5</i>上传</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>6</i>审核</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>7</i>完成</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">步骤过多会增加完成负担，应合并不必要环节</span></div>","steps-split":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>输入邮箱</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>2</i>输入密码</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>3</i>完成</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">简单登录不需要拆成多个步骤</span></div>"}}}